    },
    {
      "severity": "P2",
      "title": "noAheMutationInVerifier narrowed from whole module to the verifier function",
      "evidence": "tests/fixtures/phase-6a-v3/creator-adoption-contract.ts:1419-1428 now slices packages/node/src/creator-adoption.ts between 'export async function verifyCreatorSuccessorAdoption' (line 755) and '\\nfunction coldFailure' (line 800) before applying the mutation regex; at RED the same file contained zero AHE mutation calls, while GREEN adds input.store.swapHead at creator-adoption.ts:1416 inside the co-located recovery kernel. The retained assertion (tests/phase-6a-creator-adoption-red.test.ts:307-314) therefore no longer constrains reopenCreatorSuccessorMaterial or any future non-verifier owner in that module.",
      "required_action": "Owner D.110c-0b0: either relocate the pending-recovery kernel to its own internal module so the whole-module predicate can be restored, or add an explicit predicate that the reopen owner remains AHE-mutation-free. Accepted as-is here because the slice boundary fails closed (a reorder falls back to the whole file) and the intended verifier invariant is still proved; the change is disclosed in green-ledger.md line 59 and the fixture hash is in the manifest."
    },
    {
      "severity": "P2",
      "title": "Fail-closed matrix and six-step decision model thinner than the plan bullets",
      "evidence": "tests/phase-6b-d110c-0b0a-staged-handoff-red.test.ts covers absent, incomplete, wrong expectedNextRoomHead (asserted only as ok:false, no kind), malformed input, true fork, equivalent retries and ambiguous CAS, but has no malformed-store, wrong expectedPreviousRoomHead, foreign-store, publish wrong-head or missing-capability case, and no tests-only decision model composing stage -> modeled pending boundary -> publish -> modeled stable boundary -> recovery as required by the GREEN acceptance bullet at docs/production-hardening/production-hardening-tdd-plan-v2.md:92866-92876.",
      "required_action": "Owner D.110c-0b0, which owns the full crash matrix: add the missing fail-closed rows and the six-step composition model there. No correction required in 0b0a; requirement-9 causality (genuine Complete generations, exact swap counts, commit-then-throw reread, both orderings, equivalent retries, true fork, non-activation) is already exercised against the genuine fixture and real production modules."
    }
  ],
  "counts": { "P0": 0, "P1": 0, "P2": 3 },
  "next_state": "D110C_0B0A_CLOSED"
}

